{"generated": "2026-11-04 22:22", "brief": "<b>1. SK그룹의 SK에코플랜트 상장 철회 및 완전자회사화</b>\nSK㈜가 SK에코플랜트의 기업공개(IPO) 추진을 중단하고 1.4조 원 규모의 공개매수를 통해 완전자회사로 편입하기로 결정했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOWnFJQ05makZHdXlQT3hWOF9YQklzZnUweHdKY1Vtc0J5bDdHblJOMDMzdFdZOUplbl9HY0N1MllOcFRWY2V3bEZjcTFvYXZHNjJndTdWUXBEeXpBYVJEeXVERHdHUHFGczk2LTVKdl9seGVBdEE1U3QzMGIyaEtaUFJJZmNnejhZXzlr?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#15</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9iOWhjdFg2VGRUWGF0UEJaNW8yZy1GaVBOVEliS0Rqa1FYR094ZnhmNEExS3NmTjEzSEdzVjBhMXhoRXdJQUlHa0N5V0JacENKUDVDR0RlY1h5VXVPOGVYX0ZYNGluZjBKNDlRWnVMSlg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a>]. 이는 기존 상장 목표를 철회하고 자율적인 기업 구조조정 및 내부 경영 효율화를 도모하려는 전략적 판단으로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOWnFJQ05makZHdXlQT3hWOF9YQklzZnUweHdKY1Vtc0J5bDdHblJOMDMzdFdZOUplbl9HY0N1MllOcFRWY2V3bEZjcTFvYXZHNjJndTdWUXBEeXpBYVJEeXVERHdHUHFGczk2LTVKdl9seGVBdEE1U3QzMGIyaEtaUFJJZmNnejhZXzlr?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#15</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9iOWhjdFg2VGRUWGF0UEJaNW8yZy1GaVBOVEliS0Rqa1FYR094ZnhmNEExS3NmTjEzSEdzVjBhMXhoRXdJQUlHa0N5V0JacENKUDVDR0RlY1h5VXVPOGVYX0ZYNGluZjBKNDlRWnVMSlg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#24</a>].\n\n<b>2. 다우·CJ 컨소시엄의 중앙일보 경영권 인수</b>\n다우·CJ 컨소시엄(신세계 포함)이 5,200억 원 규모의 계약을 맺고 중앙일보 경영권을 인수합니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTFBraFhJa2FodjVuSWRjTzR1cW5YUWxvRlFxXzVIdnJ6VGxqQWMzdG8xZGtXWWtnZkpUUTBjREJTbWxrVmdRWjAxeWxBRm5HVmp6MWRBSFJBcGJiWm5rVVEtdU10UVFMdFJZOGNneWZ3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#25</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE05QVdZWXJibVlEbENheHpyWFlQUjZLOUVJWGpVZXZIT0pfV2NrTHBtdXdjX2Q3MUFteGpSclhCNHBHazlmS3RMd2p0alNlS25zZnJaTThiQ01aOUM5Y091cVUwaUN1Rnd2aTRNQVVoLTFJbFowMERfaw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5mb1EwNDktLXRJdV